<title>PORTUGAL: ING issues 3 bln esc 5-yr Navigator.</title>
<headline>ING issues 3 bln esc 5-yr Navigator.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Bank is issuing a three billion escudo five-year Navigator bond indexed to six-month Lisbor plus 10 basis points, the leader of the operation Banco Mello de Investimentos (BMI) said.</p>
<p>&quot;The nominal interest rate of the issue will be indexed to six-month Lisbor plus 10 basis points (bp), with six-monthly payment of interest,&quot; BMI said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
